msgid "Default UART order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:91
#: e27244b699e2474dbf3644c40ad15bef
msgid "SERIAL0 = console = USB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:92
#: 550455e1466147a39f78fd03376fe2e6
msgid "SERIAL1 = Telemetry1 = USART1 (RX pin only in AIO V3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:93
#: 5f6439bf584442ca930c078278ea8e55
msgid "SERIAL2 = Telemetry2 = USART2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:94
#: 78a4bb34c060447b93b3c29ae2178b73
msgid "SERIAL3 = RC Input = USART3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:95
#: e65de7a306b846c3a503c3124d845fa6
msgid "SERIAL4 = USER = USART4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:96
#: daf16a5b3cb9420191becb6a3bd9863a
msgid "SERIAL5 = USER = UART5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:97
#: d52bcfe23abd4272a0ca8fb805e5ee80
msgid "SERIAL6 = GPS = USART6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:98
#: ac85a52dd39241468e564848a09c4649
msgid "SERIAL7 = ESC Telem = UART7 (RX tied to ESC telemetry) See :ref:`blheli32-esc-telemetry`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:100
#: 6127a21a08a34d00b67916d47190430f
msgid "UART3 supports RX and TX DMA. UART1, UART2, UART4, and UART6 supports TX DMA. UART5 and UART7 do not support DMA. Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, etc.) can be adjusted to personal preferences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:103
#: eee58c538e2c4669922148f0b46722e7
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:105
#: 9c3ae805f3d54939af0dd781af475ea5
msgid "RC input is configured on the RX3 (UART3_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:107
#: 7db4c5bf893d4fe9a551be621191d7ba
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX3 pin but SBUS requires that the :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:109
#: e2f19cb2959041cd81c36e7436ef0a30
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX3 and :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:111
#: 5bc060a00ddf4b288327b56c56c6609f
msgid "CRSF also requires a TX3 connection, in addition to RX3, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:113
#: 392ac5c8124d4e50a1cd786ec19730c5
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:115
#: f5b132a24f9b41ce9b8f7576d0a5286a
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:117
#: e853259aedd446b0a76264936ecca505
msgid "In version 3, the connector intended for RC input is on the UART2, so the default protocol will need to be changed for SERIAL 2 to \"23\" and SERIAL 3 protocol changed to something else."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:119
#: 98558fbc1cbb4f0c9d404e1c01e44921
msgid "the V3 AIO moves this to UART2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:122
#: 3fc146ca5f65497fbc4901a9f198935b
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:124
#: 3158ae7df81c4384b53b357eaad7707d
msgid "The GOKU GN 745 AIO supports up to 8 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output ESC1 to ESC4 on the above diagram are the first 4 outputs, there are four additional pads for PWM 5-8. All 8 outputs support DShot as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:126
#: c5d299a25757438cb976ee25396d381c
msgid "The Nano version has 4 esc signals, current and voltage sense inputs on an external connector. The remaining outputs are on solder pads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:128
#: 1e574625d5f648d7aaa79c54adf07cd2
msgid "for users migrating from BetaflightX quads using the Nano, the first four outputs M1-M4 have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:130
#: 20b0bb10d9114fcfb1a446dcf72fad8e
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:131
#: f32262330a214b768f066cf5ae18ebd3
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:134
#: af902e09c3c44049b4ff266b097e2310
msgid "The PWM are in 5 groups: 1/2/7/8, 3/4, 5, 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:136
#: f94d34745d0b4ae8acbab1b45f989faf
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot. PWM 1-4 support bidirectional DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:141
#: ef7c21ccea1c44db9567644f356a79f8
msgid "Neopixel Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:143
#: ecf355a9628f479ab0486c0aacdcf36c
msgid "The LED pin is PWM output 9 and is default setup for use with a NeoPixel 4 led string for notifications."
msgstr ""

